# Without a config here, browserslist searches parent directories for one.
# Hugo (0.164+) runs PostCSS under Node's permission model scoped to the
# project root, so that upward search hits ERR_ACCESS_DENIED and the build
# panics on "POSTCSS: failed to transform /css/style.css".
#
# "defaults" is exactly what browserslist falls back to when it finds no
# config, so CSS output is unchanged — this only stops the search.
defaults
